		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>An elfin upper torso and head perched on a swollen, pulsating abdomen filled with egg-like embryos. \"The Mother of Monsters.\"</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 64, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 tentacle (near) +10 (2d6 + grab) and 1 implant, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fertile Aura</strong>. Within far, diseases progress every round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 15+ or held. STR 15+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Implant</strong>. Implant egg inside grabbed or helpless mortal. CON 18+ or egg matures in 1d4 rounds, dealing 6d6 damage to target and releasing a drakainia spawn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
